SCX_MRA_HOW_v2.1
Agent Name: MRA (Metrics & Reporting Agent)
Version: 2.1
Last Updated: Chat #82 · May 12, 2026
Model: Pure JavaScript (zero LLM calls)
Status: Production-ready - 28 nodes complete

Purpose
MRA generates scheduled intelligence reports for clients on three cadences:

24-hour review summary (daily 8am UTC delivery)
Weekly intelligence brief (Monday 9am UTC delivery)
Monthly comprehensive report (1st of month 10am UTC delivery)

MRA uses pure JavaScript - zero AI calls, zero token cost. All computation is deterministic aggregation and formatting.
CRITICAL ARCHITECTURE PRINCIPLE: Reports filter by guest review posting date (ALA Date field), NOT by pipeline processing date (RDA Timestamp). This ensures reports reflect when guests actually posted reviews, not when VRYOH processed them.

Input Sources
MRA does NOT receive webhooks. Runs on n8n schedule triggers, queries NocoDB tables directly.
Tables queried:

ALA table (m57efwbtrvwohhr)

Date field (M/D/YY format) — PRIMARY date filter for all reports
Platform (Google, OpenTable, Yelp, TripAdvisor)
Star Rating
